</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="group__ndxl__err_1gafa88b2be61049bce770f14eeac651348" kindref="member">NDXL_VALUE_ERR</ref> : _Edge is not connected to _Vertex.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
